{"seq":1,"slug":"origin-of-life","title":"生命起源（Origin of Life）","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/origin-of-life","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prebiotic-chemistry","title":"前生物化学（Prebiotic Chemistry）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/origin-of-life/prebiotic-chemistry","wordCount":1910,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"rna-world-hypothesis","title":"RNA世界假说（RNA World Hypothesis）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/origin-of-life/rna-world-hypothesis","wordCount":2016,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"extremophile-biology","title":"极端微生物学（Extremophile Biology）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/astrobiology/origin-of-life/extremophile-biology","wordCount":2077,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生命起源-origin-of-life\">生命起源（Origin of Life）</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>生命起源是天体生物学最根本的问题：无机物质如何在自然条件下组织成有自我复制能力的生命系统？本章从前生物化学反应、RNA世界假说到极端微生物学三个维度，系统探讨生命从无到有的可能路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心议题\">核心议题</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>议题</th>\n<th>关键问题</th>\n<th>代表性研究</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前生物化学</td>\n<td>简单分子如何形成复杂有机物？</td>\n<td>米勒-尤里实验、热液喷口假说</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RNA世界</td>\n<td>自催化RNA是否为生命前体？</td>\n<td>核酶发现、体外RNA进化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极端微生物</td>\n<td>生命的物理化学边界在哪？</td>\n<td>深海热泉古菌、辐射抗性细菌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><p>本章三篇文档按逻辑递进排列：从化学反应层面（前生物化学）→ 信息复制层面（RNA世界）→ 生命极限层面（极端微生物），逐步构建对生命起源的完整认知框架。</p>\n"}